{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tasks/a-delegated-turn-s-failure-is-reported-in-its-child-room",
  "title": "A delegated turn that fails fires ON_ERROR once in its child room, as a room's turn does, its payload a message from the agent carrying a stream's correlation id, one deeper than the task it answers, whether a transport is shared into the room or not: a stream that fails as streaming, a turn that raises as generation; the task fails, with the stream's error and without the raise's, and a shared transport is told the text the room kept",
  "rules": [
    "§23.3 step 5",
    "§23.3 step 6",
    "§12.2 step 13s",
    "§9.3"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_turn_end_doors.py::test_a_delegated_turn_s_failure_is_reported_in_the_turn_s_scope[trace], [shared]; tests/tasks/test_delegation_ends_failed.py; core/mixins/_child_execution.py _broadcast_and_collect (_report_intelligence_errors), _persist_child_stream (_report_turn_failure) on the trace, _deliver_answer (the room's reader) with a shared transport. worker's and helper's rooms share email, writer's shares nothing. A failure before the turn's record names an end is handed on as it is (_turn_failure): no narration, no loop_end_reason; a turn that raised is not responded and carries no error to the task. ON_ERROR's payload is a RoomEvent of type message, its source inbound (the model's defaults), carrying the stream's correlation_id (_fire_stream_error_hook), none for a turn that raised (_report_intelligence_errors).",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "email",
        "type": "email",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "worker",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "deltas": [
                "Checking."
              ],
              "fails": "upstream 400"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "writer",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "deltas": [
                "Checking."
              ],
              "fails": "upstream 400"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "helper",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "when": {
              "text": "Summarise the ticket and email the customer."
            },
            "fail": "The helper broke."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "parent",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "email"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "errors",
        "trigger": "on_error",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "agent_id": "worker",
      "task": "Summarise the ticket and email the customer.",
      "wait": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "failed",
          "result": {
            "status": "failed",
            "output": null,
            "error": "upstream 400"
          }
        }
      },
      "share_channels": [
        "email"
      ]
    },
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "agent_id": "writer",
      "task": "Summarise the ticket and email the customer.",
      "wait": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "failed",
          "result": {
            "status": "failed",
            "output": null,
            "error": "upstream 400"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "agent_id": "helper",
      "task": "Summarise the ticket and email the customer.",
      "wait": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "failed",
          "result": {
            "status": "failed",
            "output": null,
            "error": null
          }
        }
      },
      "share_channels": [
        "email"
      ]
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "hooks": {
      "errors": [
        {
          "trigger": "on_error",
          "room_id": "$r1",
          "event": {
            "chain_depth": 1,
            "responds_to": "$r1#0",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "worker",
              "direction": "inbound"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "upstream 400"
            },
            "metadata": {
              "error": "upstream 400",
              "error_category": "streaming"
            },
            "type": "message",
            "correlation_id": {
              "$present": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "trigger": "on_error",
          "room_id": "$r2",
          "event": {
            "chain_depth": 1,
            "responds_to": "$r2#0",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "writer",
              "direction": "inbound"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "upstream 400"
            },
            "metadata": {
              "error": "upstream 400",
              "error_category": "streaming"
            },
            "type": "message",
            "correlation_id": {
              "$present": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "trigger": "on_error",
          "room_id": "$r3",
          "event": {
            "chain_depth": 1,
            "responds_to": "$r3#0",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "helper",
              "direction": "inbound"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "The helper broke."
            },
            "metadata": {
              "error": "The helper broke.",
              "error_category": "generation"
            },
            "type": "message",
            "correlation_id": {
              "$absent": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "deliveries": {
      "$r1": {
        "email": [
          {
            "type": "message",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "worker"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "Checking."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "$r3": {
        "email": []
      }
    }
  }
}
